        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mental status examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mildly disinhibited but cooperative and fidgety, with skin picking. Speech normal in rate and volume, tangential; thought form circumstantial and concrete. Affect mildly labile, mostly euthymic to slightly irritable. Developmental delay, oriented to person and place but not date, poor recall, and limited insight and judgement."
      }
